    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Soul Gathe</strong>r <strong>is a spine-chilling indie horror experience that will test your nerves and reflexes. Set in a series of eerie, atmospheric levels, your goal is simple yet perilous: collect 10 elusive souls scattered across each map. But beware\u2014you're not alone.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585480/extras/dd001bd6afbca4e923c62e544c9ed15c.poster.avif?t=1754432356\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585480/extras/dd001bd6afbca4e923c62e544c9ed15c.webm?t=1754432356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585480/extras/dd001bd6afbca4e923c62e544c9ed15c.mp4?t=1754432356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging enemies that come out of nowhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features Automatic Wall Climbing with 3D platforming mechanics not key bound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Terrifying entities stalk your every move. From bloodthirsty demons and vengeful ghosts to grotesque clowns, deadly spiders, savage minotaur, and other nightmarish creatures, each level introduces new horrors that heighten the tension. With every soul you gather, the danger intensifies, forcing you to outwit and outrun your relentless pursuers.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585480/extras/5900c7c1915afaba6566b3ec14a34a0f.poster.avif?t=1754432356\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585480/extras/5900c7c1915afaba6566b3ec14a34a0f.webm?t=1754432356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585480/extras/5900c7c1915afaba6566b3ec14a34a0f.mp4?t=1754432356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Highlights</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrifying Entities</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Ghost girl</u></strong>\u00a0 (powers Flight Teleportation, stalking partial wall phasing during teleport, )</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Shadow shifter</u></strong>  ( Powers Hide in the shadows, Wall phase flight Audio\u00a0mimic sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Alien ghosts</u></strong>  ( Powers Flight, Teleportation, ) Queen aliens to be added later</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Demon nun</u></strong> the nuns shadow level ( Powers teleportation via player Distance)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Demon clown</u></strong> ( powers ( flight, wall phase, speed boost,)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Frost fang</u></strong> monster (snow map) ( powers Non patrols variable speeds low vision )</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Spiders</u></strong> ( Power's non strength numbers shock and surprise )\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Wraiths</u></strong> <strong>(The Wraith kings)\u00a0</strong>(Powers Fade can fade in and out of reality fast movement speed weakness holy cross slows them down)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Giant skeleton</u></strong> Monster boss battle with Multiple AI ( weakness non) Run for your dam life !\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Rouge souls</strong></u> ( red Spheres that help guide the player with audio and light indication) Aid on misty maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Evil Wizard</u></strong> Powers Super teleportation ability's due to his vast magical power Flight intrusive hard to evade)\u00a0</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Companionship</u></strong>: A pet dog Called GOOD BOY to assist in the cold or comfort players during one of the levels\u2014a nice balance to the eerie atmosphere.</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
