isty maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Evil Wizard</u></strong> Powers Super teleportation ability's due to his vast magical power Flight intrusive hard to evade)\u00a0</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Companionship</u></strong>: A pet dog Called GOOD BOY to assist in the cold or comfort players during one of the levels\u2014a nice balance to the eerie atmosphere.</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Soul Gather is an intense Challenging indie horror game where survival is key. collect 10 souls in each chilling level while evading relentless pursuers, including demons, ghosts, vampires, clowns, spiders, minotaur's, and more. Can you escape their grasp and gather all 10 of the Souls Per level ?",
